-evidence-collector.test.ts`\n\nWhat I verified:\n- Standalone `oom-kill` template is present with the expected OOM symptom patterns and `pod-oom` key prefix.\n- `matchTemplate()` now routes OOMKilled text to the dedicated OOM template instead of `generic`.\n- `collectOOMKillEvidence()` is wired into `CATEGORY_COLLECTORS` and covers:\n  - current/last terminated `OOMKilled` state\n  - memory requests/limits\n  - OOM-related events\n  - OOM-related logs\n  - init container memory/resource correlation\n- `collectMissingServiceEvidence()` is wired and checks:\n  - referenced service existence\n  - endpoint presence\n  - ready endpoint addresses\n- Template-rule fallback coverage remains in place for `generic-crash` and `missing-service`.\n- The focused and full check suites pass.\n\nChecks run:\n- `npm run lint` ✅\n- `npm run typecheck` ✅\n- `npm run unit` ✅\n- `npm run build` ✅\n\nAssessment:\n- Step 2 looks complete and correct.\n- I did not find any additional issues requiring changes.\n\nVerdict: approve","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e22c3c104fdf4860169bea22aed6c819bb6d15883928d8851\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9671,"output":1396,"cacheRead":195072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":206139,"cost":{"input":0.0241775,"output":0.02094,"cacheRead":0.048768,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.09388550000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774101002020,"responseId":"resp_0e22c3c104fdf4860169bea20a615c819b8cb174aa83ed568a"}}
